{"seq":1,"slug":"poverty-inequality","title":"贫困与不平等","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/development-economics/poverty-inequality","wordCount":2180,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"贫困与不平等\">贫困与不平等</h1><p>全球仍有约7亿人生活在极端贫困线以下，而最富有的1%人口拥有全球近一半的财富。贫困与不平等不仅是道德议题，更是影响经济增长、社会稳定和政治制度的核心经济问题。发展经济学从测量、成因和对策三个层面探索如何让更多人摆脱贫困。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>贫困有绝对贫困和相对贫困之分。世界银行设定的国际贫困线为每人每天2.15美元（2017年购买力平价），低于此标准即为极端贫困。相对贫困则以一国收入中位数的某个比例（通常为50%或60%）为标准，衡量的是社会排斥而非生存困难。</p>\n<p>不平等的常用衡量指标是基尼系数（Gini coefficient），定义为洛伦兹曲线与完全平等线之间面积与三角形面积之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = \\frac{A}{A + B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是洛伦兹曲线上方的面积。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示完全平等，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示完全不平等。对于连续收入分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = 1 - 2\\int_0^1 L(p) \\, dp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.476em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.564em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是洛伦兹函数，表示收入最低的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 比例人口占总收入的份额。</p>\n<p>其他不平等指标包括泰尔指数（Theil Index，可分解为组间和组内不平等）、帕尔马比率（最高10%与最低40%收入之比）和收入五分位数比率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"贫困的多维性\">贫困的多维性</h3><p>阿马蒂亚·森的&quot;能力方法&quot;（Capability Approach）挑战了纯粹以收入衡量贫困的做法。森认为，贫困不仅是收入不足，更是基本能力的被剥夺——包括获得营养、教育、医疗和参与社会生活的能力。联合国开发计划署据此开发了多维贫困指数（MPI），综合考虑健康（营养、儿童死亡率）、教育（受教育年限、入学率）和生活水平（饮水、卫生、能源、住房等）。</p>\n<p>一个家庭可能收入在贫困线以上但营养严重不足，也可能收入低下但通过社区互助网络维持了基本的教育和健康。收入指标无法捕捉这些差异。</p>\n<h3 id=\"贫困陷阱理论\">贫困陷阱理论</h3><p>为什么有些地区的贫困似乎是自我强化的？贫困陷阱（poverty trap）模型提供了一种解释。当存在收益递增的门槛效应时，低收入均衡和高收入均衡可以同时稳定存在。</p>\n<p>设资本积累为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{t+1} = sf(k_t) + (1-\\delta)k_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。如果生产函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在低资本水平上呈现递增收益（如S形），则存在多重稳态。低于某个临界资本水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的经济体会收敛到低均衡，高于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的经济体收敛到高均衡。</p>\n<p>杰弗里·萨克斯据此倡导&quot;大推进&quot;（Big Push）策略：通过大规模外部援助帮助穷国跨过临界门槛。但威廉·伊斯特利等人批评说，大量援助证据表明外援往往效果不佳，因为它可能加剧腐败、扭曲激励、破坏本地市场。</p>\n<h3 id=\"库兹涅茨倒u曲线\">库兹涅茨倒U曲线</h3><p>西蒙·库兹涅茨在1955年提出了著名假说：在经济发展早期，不平等随收入增长而加剧（农业人口向高收入工业部门转移，但初期只有少数人受益）；达到一定发展水平后，不平等开始下降（更多人进入现代部门，教育普及，社会保障完善）。</p>\n<p>用数学表达，设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 为人均收入，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 为基尼系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = \\beta_0 + \\beta_1 x + \\beta_2 x^2, \\quad \\beta_1 &gt; 0, \\quad \\beta_2 &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>然而，实证检验对库兹涅茨曲线的支持并不一致。东亚经济体（日本、韩国、中国台湾）在快速增长的同时保持了相对平等，而拉丁美洲许多国家在中等收入水平上停留了数十年，不平等并未下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不平等与增长的关系\">不平等与增长的关系</h3><p>不平等对增长的影响是双向的。一方面，一定程度的不平等提供了激励——高回报激励创新和冒险。另一方面，过度不平等通过以下渠道阻碍增长：</p>\n<p><strong>信贷市场不完善</strong>：穷人缺乏抵押品，无法获得贷款投资教育或创业，人力资本积累不足。如果信贷市场完美，初始财富分配对效率没有影响；但在信贷约束下，不平等直接导致效率损失。</p>\n<p><strong>政治经济渠道</strong>：高度不平等可能导致再分配压力，扭曲性税收和政策不稳定性增加，投资环境恶化。阿莱西纳和罗德里克的模型表明，中位选民理论下，不平等越严重，再分配力度越大，对增长的拖累越明显。</p>\n<p><strong>社会凝聚力</strong>：不平等加剧社会分裂、犯罪和健康问题，削弱社会资本和制度质量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"减贫的政策工具\">减贫的政策工具</h3><p><strong>有条件现金转移</strong>（Conditional Cash Transfer, CCT）是近二十年最成功的减贫创新之一。墨西哥的&quot;机遇计划&quot;（Oportunidades）和巴西的&quot;家庭补助金&quot;（Bolsa Família）向贫困家庭发放现金，条件是子女必须上学、定期体检。随机控制试验（RCT）证实CCT显著提高了入学率、降低了儿童营养不良率。</p>\n<p><strong>小额信贷</strong>（Microfinance）为穷人提供小额贷款，绕过传统银行的抵押品要求。尤努斯创办的格莱珉银行因此获得2006年诺贝尔和平奖。但后续RCT研究表明，小额信贷对减贫的效果不如最初预期，主要受益者是已有一定经营能力的人。</p>\n<p><strong>土地改革</strong>在东亚的成功经验（日本、韩国、中国台湾战后土改）表明，更平等的土地分配可以同时促进公平和效率。但拉丁美洲和非洲的土改经历则复杂得多，往往因政治阻力和执行问题而收效甚微。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>假设一个5人经济体，收入分别为1、2、3、4、10（万元）。计算基尼系数和洛伦兹曲线。如果政府通过累进税和转移支付将收入调整为2、2.5、3、3.5、9，新的基尼系数是多少？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么中国在1978-2020年间成功让8亿人脱贫，而印度的减贫进度相对缓慢？从制度、政策和初始条件三个维度分析。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>无条件基本收入（UBI）相比有条件现金转移有什么优劣？从激励效应、行政成本和人的尊严三个角度讨论。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>皮凯蒂的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r &gt; g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>（资本回报率高于经济增长率）假说如何解释不平等的长期趋势？这一论证有什么局限？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>阿马蒂亚·森因贫困和福利经济学研究获1998年诺贝尔经济学奖。阿比吉特·班纳吉和埃斯特·迪弗洛因发展经济学中的随机控制试验方法获2019年诺贝尔经济学奖，他们的著作《贫穷的本质》以生动的方式介绍了穷人面临的真实决策困境。</p>\n<p>托马斯·皮凯蒂的《21世纪资本论》重新点燃了关于不平等的公共讨论，他利用跨越两个世纪的税收数据论证了资本集中的长期趋势。布兰科·米兰诺维奇的《全球不平等》则提供了全球视角。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>贫困与不平等的研究涵盖了从测量方法到理论解释再到政策设计的完整链条。基尼系数和多维贫困指数提供了量化工具，贫困陷阱理论和信贷市场不完善解释了持续性贫困的机制，CCT和小额信贷等政策创新则在实践中经受了严格的实验检验。理解这些议题是思考发展战略和社会正义的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"institutional-economics\">制度经济学</a>——贫困陷阱的持续性、土地改革的成败，最终都要回到产权与制度质量来解释。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../microeconomics/consumer-theory\">消费者理论</a>——森的&quot;能力方法&quot;挑战的正是把效用等同于收入的传统消费者模型，两篇对照可见福利度量的张力。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/random-variables/joint-distributions\">联合分布</a>——基尼系数与洛伦兹曲线本质是对收入分布的刻画，理解联合分布与边际分布才能算清不平等指标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贫困与不平等","id":"贫困与不平等"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"贫困的多维性","id":"贫困的多维性"},{"level":3,"text":"贫困陷阱理论","id":"贫困陷阱理论"},{"level":3,"text":"库兹涅茨倒U曲线","id":"库兹涅茨倒u曲线"},{"level":3,"text":"不平等与增长的关系","id":"不平等与增长的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"减贫的政策工具","id":"减贫的政策工具"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"经济增长理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory"},"next":{"title":"贸易与发展","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/development-economics/trade-and-development"}}